{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00884",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.03,
      "end_seconds": 13.16,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "I can't concentrate on anything lately. I think I might have ADHD, because I've always been a bit like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.15,
      "end_seconds": 23.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "Thanks for telling me. Let's talk it through. What happens when you try to concentrate?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.68,
      "end_seconds": 35.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "My mind just wanders off. I start something and then I forget what I was doing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.84,
      "end_seconds": 42.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "How long has this been a problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.72,
      "end_seconds": 52.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Since school, really. But it's worse now that I'm working from home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.29,
      "end_seconds": 59.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Is it only with work, or everywhere? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.95,
      "end_seconds": 66.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Everywhere. Reading, films, even conversations. I zone out. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.54,
      "end_seconds": 73.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "How are you sleeping?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.72,
      "end_seconds": 83.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Badly. I lie awake until two or three in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.9,
      "end_seconds": 92.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Any low mood or worry that could be contributing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.27,
      "end_seconds": 101.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "No, I'm not low. I'm not particularly anxious either."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.7,
      "end_seconds": 108.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Are you taking any medicines at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.26,
      "end_seconds": 122.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.96,
      "text": "Just a multivitamin. And occasionally a sleeping tablet, I think it's zolpidem, 5 mg, but I'm not sure of the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.13,
      "end_seconds": 129.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "How often do you take the sleeping tablet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.38,
      "end_seconds": 136.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Maybe once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.25,
      "end_seconds": 145.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Thank you. Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.52,
      "end_seconds": 156.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "When I was a child I reacted badly to penicillin and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.0,
      "end_seconds": 164.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Noted. Do you drink coffee or alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.66,
      "end_seconds": 172.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Coffee, yes. Six or seven cups a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.01,
      "end_seconds": 184.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "That's a lot, and it can disturb sleep and concentration. Let me check your pulse and pressure. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.19,
      "end_seconds": 196.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.87,
      "end_seconds": 205.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Pulse 78, blood pressure 122 over 76, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.71,
      "end_seconds": 210.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Normal? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.37,
      "end_seconds": 224.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Normal. Let me ask a few more things about school. Did your teachers ever comment on your attention?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.91,
      "end_seconds": 233.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Yes. My reports always said I was easily distracted and daydreaming."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.39,
      "end_seconds": 241.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "That history matters, because ADHD has to start in childhood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.85,
      "end_seconds": 249.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "So could it be ADHD? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.43,
      "end_seconds": 264.16,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "It's possible, but poor sleep and six or seven coffees can look very much the same. I can't tell yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.1,
      "end_seconds": 270.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "What next? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.43,
      "end_seconds": 283.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Cut the coffee to two cups, and aim for a regular sleep time. We'll see how much changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.1,
      "end_seconds": 288.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I can try. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.78,
      "end_seconds": 299.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "If it doesn't help, I'd refer you for a specialist assessment, rather than start any medicine today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.44,
      "end_seconds": 306.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "All right. Thank you. ~"
    }
  ]
}
